Comment: 50,0:00:17.00,0:00:17.04,Default,chptr,0,0,0,,Cold Open
Comment: 50,0:03:21.97,0:03:22.01,Default,chptr,0,0,0,opsync,OP
Comment: 50,0:04:53.02,0:04:53.06,Default,chptr,0,0,0,,Part A
Comment: 50,0:11:25.00,0:11:25.04,Default,chptr,0,0,0,,Part B
Comment: 50,0:22:22.99,0:22:23.03,Default,chptr,0,0,0,edsync,ED
Comment: 50,0:23:52.99,0:23:53.04,Default,chptr,0,0,0,,Preview
Dialogue: 50,0:00:27.42,0:00:29.05,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Where are you going?
Dialogue: 50,0:00:31.09,0:00:33.51,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Wait up! Hey!
Dialogue: 50,0:00:41.15,0:00:42.36,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,She's gone?
Dialogue: 50,0:00:42.77,0:00:44.36,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Lilly! Where are you?
Dialogue: 50,0:00:45.48,0:00:46.94,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,What the..?
Dialogue: 50,0:00:47.49,0:00:48.86,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,The door won't open.
Dialogue: 50,0:00:59.33,0:01:02.63,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,This is bad. I'm not getting any signal.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:03.13,0:01:04.04,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Any luck, Lulu?
Dialogue: 50,0:01:05.50,0:01:06.50,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,It won't connect.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:07.38,0:01:09.38,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,The window won't open at all.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:10.01,0:01:11.51,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 50,0:01:12.76,0:01:16.18,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Where'd Lilly run off to...?
Dialogue: 50,0:01:25.06,0:01:26.36,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 50,0:01:26.36,0:01:29.15,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Did that cup just move on its own?
Dialogue: 50,0:01:29.15,0:01:30.19,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Yes...
Dialogue: 50,0:01:45.00,0:01:46.13,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,I got it!
Dialogue: 50,0:01:46.50,0:01:48.55,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Girls, come over here!
Dialogue: 50,0:01:48.55,0:01:49.30,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:49.30,0:01:50.01,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 50,0:01:51.22,0:01:54.34,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Guess what? I figured it out!
Dialogue: 50,0:01:55.14,0:01:58.10,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,This is a prank!
Dialogue: 50,0:01:59.72,0:02:01.31,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,A prank, you say?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:01.31,0:02:02.35,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:02.35,0:02:06.44,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,We must be getting pranked\Nfor a TV show.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:07.69,0:02:11.49,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,It's an elaborate stunt,\Nso maybe we're on ARS TV again!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:11.86,0:02:14.99,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,If we can give a good reaction,\Nit might boost our popularity!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:14.99,0:02:18.95,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,So both of you give it your best,\Nmost natural shock!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:18.95,0:02:21.75,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,I don't think that's what's happening here.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:24.87,0:02:28.84,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,I'm gonna sweep the first floor for her again,\Nso you two check upstairs!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:30.17,0:02:33.47,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Eek! I'm scared!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:33.84,0:02:36.22,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,What's happening here?!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:36.22,0:02:39.47,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,I can't bear this any longer!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:39.47,0:02:42.89,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Lilly, where are you-u-u?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:42.89,0:02:44.52,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,T-Toko-san?!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:44.52,0:02:48.19,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Come out!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:48.52,0:02:49.98,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,A prank?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:49.98,0:02:51.53,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Is it really?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:52.99,0:02:54.57,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Let's move.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:58.49,0:02:59.45,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:12.42,0:03:14.26,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Am I seeing things?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:14.26,0:03:15.26,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Lulu?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:17.22,0:03:18.22,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Coming!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:59.11,0:05:02.99,Default,Phone,0,0,0,,{\i1}The number you have dialed\Nis currently not in service.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:03.49,0:05:06.49,Default,Phone,0,0,0,,{\i1}Please check the number and try again.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:07.95,0:05:09.08,Default,Yasuo,0,0,0,,No good.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:13.92,0:05:15.96,Default,Driver,0,0,0,,Where to, sir?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:15.96,0:05:18.55,Default,Yasuo,0,0,0,,There's this white cottage by the coast, yes?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:18.55,0:05:20.97,Default,Yasuo,0,0,0,,It's a bit far from the other hotels.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:20.97,0:05:22.47,Default,Yasuo,0,0,0,,Please take me there.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:22.47,0:05:23.34,Default,Driver,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:24.05,0:05:26.01,Default,Yasuo,0,0,0,,Hm? What's the matter?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:26.01,0:05:27.56,Default,Driver,0,0,0,,Er, nothing.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:29.60,0:05:31.06,Default,Driver,0,0,0,,So, sir.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:31.06,0:05:33.40,Default,Driver,0,0,0,,What takes you to a place like that?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:33.94,0:05:35.73,Default,Yasuo,0,0,0,,Like what?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:36.27,0:05:39.11,Default,Driver,0,0,0,,That house is haunted.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:39.74,0:05:43.16,Default,Yasuo,0,0,0,,Haunted? Like by ghosts?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:43.16,0:05:46.74,Default,Driver,0,0,0,,Yeah. It's well known around these parts.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:46.74,0:05:50.33,Default,Driver,0,0,0,,You really oughta keep your distance.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:53.37,0:05:54.79,Default,Yasuo,0,0,0,,I had no idea.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:56.71,0:05:59.42,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Lilly, where are you?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:04.05,0:06:06.05,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,If you hear me, say something!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:14.81,0:06:19.03,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,If this really is a prank,\Ndo you think the president's in on it?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:19.57,0:06:21.32,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:21.86,0:06:25.53,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,He mentioned this place was\Ncheap to rent.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:25.53,0:06:27.33,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Maybe that was all a setup.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:27.83,0:06:30.62,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,God, and to think he's always so lax.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:39.63,0:06:40.59,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Lilly?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:41.46,0:06:43.26,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,She's not here, is she?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:43.26,0:06:44.09,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Nope.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:58.36,0:07:00.65,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,She really should tidy up once in a while.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:00.65,0:07:01.86,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,No kidding.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:05.11,0:07:06.86,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,She's not here either.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:06.86,0:07:09.12,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Where could she be?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:15.96,0:07:17.71,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,We're locked in...
Dialogue: 50,0:07:19.92,0:07:22.21,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Lulu, can you act?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:22.21,0:07:25.59,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,No, I'm not that good...
Dialogue: 50,0:07:26.09,0:07:28.84,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,I see. Me neither.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:30.81,0:07:32.89,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Wonder what else we can do.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:34.10,0:07:35.43,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Let's chat.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:36.56,0:07:39.65,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,If we stay silent, they'll just pull\Nsomething on us again.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:41.48,0:07:44.44,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Um... Can I ask you something?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:44.44,0:07:45.28,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,What's up?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:46.53,0:07:50.66,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Being an idol was Toko-san's dream... right?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:52.83,0:07:55.16,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Yeah. Is this about yesterday?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:55.54,0:07:58.12,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Yes. I got curious about it.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:59.17,0:08:02.63,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,In that case, what's your dream?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:03.67,0:08:05.01,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 50,0:08:08.97,0:08:12.18,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Toko roped me into her dream.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:12.76,0:08:14.18,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,She did?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:14.93,0:08:19.19,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,I like dressing up and dancing,\Nbut that's it.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:19.73,0:08:23.77,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,I hadn't thought at all about\Nwhat I wanted to do in the future.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:24.57,0:08:29.57,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Then Toko told me out of nowhere,\N"let's become idols!"
Dialogue: 50,0:08:30.20,0:08:32.16,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:33.45,0:08:36.62,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Yeah. She didn't listen to what I had to say, and told me:
Dialogue: 50,0:08:36.62,0:08:40.50,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,"If I have you, I know I can make it.\NSo let's do it together."
Dialogue: 50,0:08:42.29,0:08:46.26,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,She was so selfish, but I ended up\Nreally loving it.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:47.67,0:08:50.80,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Almost like she cast a spell on me.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:52.64,0:08:54.18,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,I know how you feel.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:56.52,0:08:57.85,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:00.81,0:09:02.15,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Footsteps!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:09.99,0:09:12.20,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,What was that sound?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:15.66,0:09:16.49,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,A-An axe?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:30.55,0:09:32.97,Default,Yasuo,0,0,0,,Hey, are we getting there?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:33.72,0:09:36.10,Default,Driver,0,0,0,,I'm going as fast as I can...
Dialogue: 50,0:09:37.22,0:09:39.73,Default,Driver,0,0,0,,but we're not getting any closer.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:39.73,0:09:41.39,Default,Yasuo,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:41.39,0:09:42.23,Default,Driver,0,0,0,,Look.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:43.52,0:09:45.15,Default,Driver,0,0,0,,We're not moving!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:50.36,0:09:51.74,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Wh-What the?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:56.87,0:10:00.70,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Th-There's no way this is just a prank.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:00.70,0:10:03.04,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Then, what is it?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:04.83,0:10:07.46,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Paranormal activity...?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:09.96,0:10:12.34,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Is the power back?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:18.39,0:10:21.98,Default,Rin,0,0,0,,{\i1}Now, it's time for Mischief Cooking!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:22.94,0:10:26.48,Default,Rin,0,0,0,,{\i1}Here's our guests for today!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:28.90,0:10:31.24,Default,Rin,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's the newbie idols!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:33.20,0:10:36.66,Default,Rin,0,0,0,,{\i1}The food's almost ready!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:37.53,0:10:39.08,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,What the heck?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:50.80,0:10:52.30,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Hold on a minute!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:00.60,0:11:04.60,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,I've actually been looking all over,
Dialogue: 50,0:11:06.27,0:11:09.48,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,and I couldn't find any cameras anywhere.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:09.94,0:11:11.40,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,That tracks...
Dialogue: 50,0:11:17.16,0:11:18.99,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Is this really a pra—
Dialogue: 50,0:11:22.45,0:11:23.66,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Toko!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:22.45,0:11:23.66,Alt,Rui,0,0,0,,Toko-san!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:26.46,0:11:27.46,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Toko!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:30.54,0:11:32.88,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,What's with these things?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:35.55,0:11:37.89,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Toko's in danger! I'm going downstairs!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:38.39,0:11:39.80,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Sena-san, wait!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:42.68,0:11:43.43,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Toko!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:43.43,0:11:44.31,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Toko-san!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:00.66,0:12:03.54,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,It's those stuffed animals again... Why?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:08.42,0:12:11.09,Default,Creature,0,0,0,,{\i1}Are you scared? Isn't this fun?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:11.50,0:12:14.51,Default,Creature,0,0,0,,{\i1}Who should I pick next?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:24.60,0:12:25.77,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Dang it!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:27.64,0:12:28.35,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Lulu!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:30.27,0:12:31.11,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Sena-san?!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:39.07,0:12:41.57,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Lulu, run for it! Go call for help!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:41.99,0:12:44.08,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,No! What about you, Sena-san?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:45.49,0:12:48.50,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,It's fine. I'll look for Toko.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:52.08,0:12:55.09,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Even if we don't come back,\Nkeep being an idol.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:55.09,0:12:56.34,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Sena-san!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:56.92,0:12:58.84,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Take this!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:58.84,0:13:01.30,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Sena-san! Sena-san!!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:06.18,0:13:07.60,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Please, no more!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:39.09,0:13:39.84,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:44.47,0:13:48.47,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,{\i1}Oh, right. I followed that stuffie.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:50.10,0:13:52.94,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,{\i1}Uguisu isn't here. Where is he?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:53.52,0:13:54.98,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,{\an8}Let me out of here!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:54.98,0:13:58.23,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,{\an8}I'm begging you! Please stop!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:56.36,0:13:57.52,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Lulu-chan!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:04.24,0:14:07.24,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Stop! Don't come in here!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:07.62,0:14:09.50,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Someone help me...!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:14.79,0:14:16.63,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Lililula, palilula!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:16.63,0:14:19.38,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Please save Lulu-chan!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:59.55,0:15:00.96,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,It worked!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:21.28,0:15:22.57,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,I can't go on...
Dialogue: 50,0:15:23.69,0:15:27.91,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,But... everyone else is still stuck in there...
Dialogue: 50,0:15:41.13,0:15:42.00,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Tohre.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:47.18,0:15:48.43,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,I'm going home.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:03.40,0:16:06.45,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,I have to go back.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:11.37,0:16:11.95,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:16.21,0:16:17.46,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Is that...?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:18.33,0:16:23.30,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Was everything until now caused by magic?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:27.09,0:16:27.97,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Letto.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:45.98,0:16:48.36,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Lululila, pululila!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:48.70,0:16:51.03,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Pop'n pam!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:22.40,0:17:24.86,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Please help me save everyone!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:33.91,0:17:36.08,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Does this mean I have to fight?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:48.17,0:17:51.80,Default,Creature,0,0,0,,Hey you! You scared?\NKeep runnin'!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:51.80,0:17:55.03,Default,Creature,0,0,0,,I'm gonna eat'cha! Take this! And this!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:57.31,0:18:01.98,Default,Creature,0,0,0,,Once I finish up this brat,\NI'mma go pick on the girl that ran off!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:03.94,0:18:05.81,Default,Creature,0,0,0,,Hey! Take that!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:05.81,0:18:06.86,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:06.86,0:18:08.44,Default,Creature,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:09.40,0:18:10.94,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,I said "hey."
Dialogue: 50,0:18:10.94,0:18:14.45,Default,Creature,0,0,0,,Put a sock in it.\NI'm in the middle of—huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:16.45,0:18:18.45,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,You're from the magical land, yes?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:21.04,0:18:22.75,Default,Creature,0,0,0,,Huh?! I am, I am!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:23.87,0:18:25.25,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:25.75,0:18:29.21,Default,Creature,0,0,0,,Wh-What's it look like? I'm playing!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:29.21,0:18:31.26,Default,Creature,0,0,0,,Humans {\i1}love{\i0} being scared!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:31.26,0:18:33.88,Default,Creature,0,0,0,,S-So I thought I was doing good...
Dialogue: 50,0:18:33.88,0:18:38.18,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,I ask that you turn everything\Nto normal right now.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:38.18,0:18:40.14,Default,Creature,0,0,0,,Okay. I'm sorry...
Dialogue: 50,0:18:41.02,0:18:44.69,Default,Creature,0,0,0,,W-Well, I'm off!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:51.94,0:18:54.82,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,No! Stay away!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:59.91,0:19:01.20,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,They stopped...
Dialogue: 50,0:19:09.38,0:19:10.13,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Where am I?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:10.13,0:19:10.71,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Toko!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:10.71,0:19:14.42,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Sena! This is a prank, right? Right?!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:16.30,0:19:17.93,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,I don't know for sure...
Dialogue: 50,0:19:18.60,0:19:19.97,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,but it looks like it's over.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:25.39,0:19:26.31,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Lilly-san!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:26.31,0:19:27.44,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Lulu-chan!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:27.81,0:19:31.94,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Thank goodness, Sena-san and Toko-san are safe too.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:32.36,0:19:34.95,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Sorry about all of this.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:35.40,0:19:38.28,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,I have no idea what it was about either.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:38.28,0:19:40.74,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Paranormal activity, probably.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:40.74,0:19:42.20,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Like a ghost.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:42.20,0:19:44.71,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,A ghost? Wasn't that...
Dialogue: 50,0:19:45.46,0:19:48.71,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,...something, right? Who knows!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:48.71,0:19:54.05,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,{\i1}I hadn't thought that there\Nwere other magicians besides me.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:55.22,0:19:57.97,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,So, what are we doing now?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:57.97,0:20:01.56,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,I don't think we can continue\Nour training camp like this.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:08.23,0:20:10.48,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Let's have a barbecue!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:10.48,0:20:11.44,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:11.44,0:20:12.86,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,You don't wanna?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:12.86,0:20:14.74,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,I do, it's just...
Dialogue: 50,0:20:14.74,0:20:18.74,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Then let's do it!\NThe best way to end this is on a fun note!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:20.07,0:20:21.62,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Sure then, let's have a barbecue!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:21.62,0:20:22.66,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Agreed.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:22.66,0:20:23.37,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:23.37,0:20:25.16,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:25.16,0:20:26.87,Default,Yasuo,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:27.58,0:20:30.79,Default,Yasuo,0,0,0,,Are you girls okay?!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:31.63,0:20:35.55,Default,Yasuo,0,0,0,,My taxi kept looping in circles!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:35.55,0:20:37.72,Default,Yasuo,0,0,0,,{\an8}Apparently this place is haunted!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:37.72,0:20:41.26,Default,Yasuo,0,0,0,,{\an8}I'm sorry! Terribly, terribly sorry!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:41.26,0:20:43.31,Default,Yasuo,0,0,0,,{\an8}The drive here was rough!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:36.63,0:20:38.22,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,What's all that stuff?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:39.01,0:20:41.55,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Exorcism items?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:44.26,0:20:45.27,Default,Yasuo,0,0,0,,Here's your meat.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:45.27,0:20:47.06,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Yippee!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:47.06,0:20:49.39,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,You need to be more careful.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:49.39,0:20:52.36,Default,Yasuo,0,0,0,,Says the one who got all excited from the price.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:52.36,0:20:53.32,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Can you blame me?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:53.32,0:20:55.28,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Seconds, please!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:55.28,0:20:56.69,Default,Yasuo,0,0,0,,It's on the grill now!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:56.69,0:20:59.15,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Forget that! Gimme the meat!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:59.15,0:21:00.91,Default,Yasuo,0,0,0,,Show some patience!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:00.91,0:21:02.91,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Lilly's as perky as ever.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:02.91,0:21:03.78,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,She sure is.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:05.16,0:21:07.50,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,About when we got locked in that room.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:08.71,0:21:09.29,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:10.29,0:21:13.71,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,I think... I said some weird things back there.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:14.21,0:21:15.80,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Please don't tell Toko all that.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:16.09,0:21:17.67,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Why not?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:20.72,0:21:22.05,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,It's embarrassing.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:25.06,0:21:26.31,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,I understand.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:26.31,0:21:27.81,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Do you promise?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:28.18,0:21:28.89,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:29.77,0:21:32.56,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,I'll keep being an idol!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:35.36,0:21:36.57,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Bold talk.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:37.11,0:21:39.49,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,{\an8}Lilly, that's my meat!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:39.49,0:21:42.16,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,{\an8}Toko-san, you should eat your green peppers!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:40.90,0:21:44.95,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Let's go. If we don't hurry,\Nthose two will eat everything.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:44.95,0:21:45.58,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:13.35,0:22:15.44,Default,Azuki,0,0,0,,Open up!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:15.44,0:22:17.69,Default,Uguisu,0,0,0,,Let us out!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:18.44,0:22:22.36,Default,Uguisu/Azuki,0,0,0,,Aren't you forgetting us?!
